<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 你写哪类程序</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>所有能力都是插件 —— 包括「改它自己」这件事</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 32}}><Box style={{width: 560, flexDirection: "column", gap: 14, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 12}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 60, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23"}}>工具</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 60, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23"}}>模型</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 60, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23"}}>子 agent</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 60, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23"}}>会话存储</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 12, alignItems: "center"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 60, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23"}}>权限</Text></Box><Box style={{width: 150, height: 108, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.12)", borderRadius: 10, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", border: "2px dashed rgba(15,110,86,0.55)"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>内核</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 60, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23"}}>命令</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 12}}><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 60, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23"}}>技能</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, height: 60, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#1C1F23"}}>扩展</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", padding: "0 6px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5}}>Cordis 元框架：不存在必须改源码才能动的东西。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 14}}>四种运行模式，本质是四套默认插件集——不是四种产品。</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 16, marginTop: 16}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>· Goal</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>· Ralph</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>· workflow</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 19, color: "#0F6E56"}}>· Spawn-Fork</Text></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 20, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 18}}>落点：它把「可改」这件事做成了架构属性，不是配置项。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 16}}>插件位不是设计稿：社区插件目录 33 天收到 3722 条（2026-09-15 快照，⚠️ 趋势级），做增强的占 51%、运行与治理占 19.7%——那一圈的零件，已经有人在批量供给。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>31 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
